  "At year-end 2020, current assets were Rp1,535.266bn and current liabilities were Rp2,763.099bn. Their difference was −Rp1,227.833bn, or approximately −Rp1.23tn. This indicates constrained short-term financial capacity; it does not by itself establish when every payment is due.": "Pada akhir 2020, aset lancar Rp1.535,266 miliar dan liabilitas lancar Rp2.763,099 miliar. Selisihnya −Rp1.227,833 miliar, sekitar −Rp1,23 triliun. Angka ini menunjukkan kapasitas keuangan jangka pendek yang terbatas, tetapi tidak menentukan waktu jatuh tempo seluruh pembayaran.",
  "Source: case, printed pp. 588–590, Exhibits 2, 3, and 5. Units in the original financial exhibits are millions of rupiah; this section converts them to billions and trillions.": "Sumber: kasus, hlm. cetak 588–590, Eksibit 2, 3, dan 5. Satuan asli laporan adalah juta rupiah; bagian ini mengonversinya menjadi miliar dan triliun.",
