  "Promotional image · 2025": "Gambar promosi · 2025",
  "Formats: case pp. 590–592 · Images: mppa.co.id, illustrative; not evidence of 2020 conditions": "Format: kasus hlm. 590–592 · Gambar: mppa.co.id, ilustrasi; bukan bukti kondisi 2020",
  "The case groups the seven formats into large stores, small stores, and wholesale. The formats address different needs, from broad household shopping to premium groceries, neighborhood purchases, health and beauty, and convenience.": "Kasus mengelompokkan tujuh format menjadi gerai besar, gerai kecil, dan grosir. Format tersebut melayani beragam kebutuhan, mulai dari belanja rumah tangga lengkap hingga produk premium, belanja lingkungan, kesehatan dan kecantikan, serta kepraktisan.",
  "Convenient grocery shopping, fresh food, and ready-to-eat meals.": "Belanja kebutuhan sehari-hari, pangan segar, dan makanan siap santap secara praktis.",
  "Store illustration · MPPA website": "Ilustrasi gerai · Situs MPPA",
