  "Snacks, drinks, and ready-to-eat food in convenient locations.": "Camilan, minuman, dan makanan siap santap di lokasi praktis.",
  "The wholesale format identified in the case portfolio.": "Format grosir yang tercantum dalam portofolio kasus.",
