  "Each category distinguishes sourced external evidence, our assessment of MPPA’s exposure, and a possible response to evaluate. Evidence is from 2020–2021. Policy dates and geography are explicit; the food-waste range is historical, not a trend forecast. National adoption and demand data do not establish MPPA-specific returns. See Notes for the AQCD limitations and source references.": "Setiap kategori memisahkan bukti eksternal bersumber, penilaian paparan MPPA, dan calon respons. Bukti berasal dari 2020–2021. Tanggal serta wilayah kebijakan dijelaskan; rentang sisa pangan bersifat historis, bukan ramalan tren. Data nasional tidak menentukan imbal hasil MPPA. Lihat Catatan untuk keterbatasan AQCD dan sumber.",
