  "BPS survey, 2020: 31% reported more online shopping, 28% less, and 41% unchanged.": "Survei BPS 2020: 31% lebih sering belanja daring, 28% berkurang, dan 41% tetap.",
  "In BPS’s 2020 respondent survey, 31% reported increased online shopping during COVID-19, 28% decreased, and the remaining 41% were unchanged.": "Dalam survei responden BPS 2020, 31% melaporkan peningkatan belanja daring selama COVID-19, 28% menurun, dan 41% lainnya tetap.",
  "Indonesian survey respondents; useful for testing online ordering and physical-store access across MPPA formats.": "Responden survei Indonesia; relevan untuk menguji pesanan daring dan akses gerai fisik pada berbagai format MPPA.",
  "Shopping behavior was mixed. A segment increased online activity, while others reduced it or stayed unchanged; a uniform shift should not be assumed.": "Perilaku belanja beragam. Sebagian meningkatkan aktivitas daring, sementara lainnya mengurangi atau tetap; pergeseran yang seragam tidak dapat diasumsikan.",
  "Test online ordering and pickup with defined customer groups; compare repeat orders, basket values, and contribution after fulfillment costs.": "Uji pemesanan daring dan pengambilan pesanan pada kelompok pelanggan tertentu; bandingkan pesanan berulang, nilai keranjang, dan kontribusi setelah biaya pemenuhan.",
  "Voluntary online survey using non-probability sampling, not a representative population estimate. These are respondent shares, not sales-growth rates or measured MPPA customer behavior.": "Survei daring sukarela dengan sampel nonprobabilitas, bukan estimasi yang mewakili populasi. Angka merupakan proporsi responden, bukan pertumbuhan penjualan atau perilaku pelanggan MPPA yang terukur.",
  "Quantitative comparison of reported behavior categories. Before-pandemic levels and MPPA-format results were not measured; divisional relevance is an application to test.": "Perbandingan kuantitatif kategori perilaku yang dilaporkan. Tingkat sebelum pandemi dan hasil tiap format MPPA tidak diukur; relevansi divisi perlu diuji.",
